+/*!
+ * @ingroup tuning
+ * @def XXH_DEBUGLEVEL
+ * @brief Sets the debugging level.
+ *
+ * XXH_DEBUGLEVEL is expected to be defined externally, typically via the
+ * compiler's command line options. The value must be a number.
